{"seq":7,"slug":"ai-transformation","title":"蓝箭航天AI转型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/landspace/ai-transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-rocket-design","title":"AI在火箭设计中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/landspace/ai-transformation/ai-rocket-design","wordCount":1874,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-manufacturing","title":"AI智能制造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/landspace/ai-transformation/ai-manufacturing","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-workforce-impact","title":"AI对蓝箭航天岗位的冲击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/landspace/ai-transformation/ai-workforce-impact","wordCount":1708,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-practice-guide","title":"工程师AI实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/landspace/ai-transformation/ai-practice-guide","wordCount":1823,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"蓝箭航天ai转型\">蓝箭航天AI转型</h1><p>本章分析人工智能技术在蓝箭航天各环节的应用现状与趋势，包括AI在火箭设计中的加速作用、智能制造中的质量革命、对岗位结构的冲击，以及工程师如何拥抱AI工具提升竞争力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心洞察\">核心洞察</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>AI是加速器而非替代者</strong>：火箭研发的物理验证无法被AI绕过，但AI可大幅缩短&quot;设计-仿真-优化&quot;循环</li>\n<li><strong>制造端最先落地</strong>：焊接质量检测、缺陷预测等已有成熟方案</li>\n<li><strong>GNC方向AI化最深</strong>：自适应控制、实时优化本质就是AI问题</li>\n<li><strong>结构性岗位变化不可避免</strong>：重复性分析岗将收缩，AI工具使用能力成为新门槛</li>\n</ul>\n"}